usage: narrative_transport_cli.py [-h] --config CONFIG
                                  [--operation {reference,read,evidence-list,evidence-lookup,evidence-search}]
                                  [--limit LIMIT] [--offset OFFSET]
                                  [--span-id SPAN_ID] [--locator LOCATOR]
                                  [--query QUERY]

Read persistent narrative bundles by logical identity, never raw file paths.
stdin: bounded versioned JSON request. stdout: exact artifact bytes (or
reference). stderr: one JSON receipt/refusal. Consumers require exit 0 and
verify stdout SHA.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --operation {reference,read,evidence-list,evidence-lookup,evidence-search}
  --limit LIMIT
  --offset OFFSET
  --span-id SPAN_ID
  --locator LOCATOR
  --query QUERY
